[h2]Build 0.9.131[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Core upgrades for the industrial repair center.[/b] It is built with a basic subcore; an Upgrade core button lets you give it a better one, which a constructor brings from storage and installs. Each tier up adds +4 crafting skill (up to 20), works 20% faster and uses 20% fewer repair materials:
[list]
[*]Standard subcore: +4 skill, 20% faster, 20% fewer materials
[*]High subcore: +8 skill, 40% faster, 40% fewer materials
[*]Persona core: +12 skill, 60% faster, 60% fewer materials
[/list]
[*]The core it replaces comes back out (the basic subcore stays part of the building), and an upgraded core is returned when the machine is deconstructed. The installed core and its bonuses show in the inspect pane.
[/list]
